# Adds a small kerning table to Micro5x7. Pairs must reference glyphs that
# exist in the font; every pair here is a real letter that ships in the font.
# Used to regenerate sample/fonts/Micro5x7.gff:
#   java -jar build/glyphforge.jar edit --font sample/fonts/Micro5x7.gff --script sample/scripts/kern-micro5x7.gfs
kern A V -1
kern A W -1
kern A T -1
kern A Y -1
kern L T -1
kern T o -1
kern V a -1
kern W a -1
kern Y o -1
kern r y -1
status
quit